config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_272_NETSPD
  bool "BK7258 RPMsg frame-path probe (netspd)"
  default n
  ---help---
    Measure the CP/AP RPMsg frame path with netspd echo / netspd send.
    Endpoints use explicit addresses and an empty name, so no NS
    announcement is involved and either side may start first.
